# Docs contract

- Every product under `apps/`, `libs/`, `projects/`, `services/` ships a Sphinx `docs/` node.
- Add a card on the matching topology hub under `docs/landing/`
  (`apps/` / `libs/` / `projects/` / `services/` / `docs/`) pointing at the published path prefix.
- Narrative docs use emoji wayfinding and Mermaid diagrams for architecture / flows.
- Build with `poe docs` → `site/`.
